1
00:00:00,418 --> 00:00:02,948
(Mike:)In space,
you couldn't even toss me a pen,

2
00:00:02,954 --> 00:00:05,524
(Mike:)and that was in zero gravity.

3
00:00:06,858 --> 00:00:08,988
(Howard:)Okay, thanks for the pep talk.

4
00:00:08,993 --> 00:00:10,263
(Mike:)Anytime, Froot Loops.

5
00:00:11,362 --> 00:00:13,032
(Mike:)Give your wife a hug for me.

6
00:00:13,031 --> 00:00:16,161
(Mike:)She's so much cuter than you, I
don't know how you ever got her.

7
00:00:16,167 --> 00:00:18,337
(Skype blips off)

8
00:00:18,336 --> 00:00:20,406
(Bernadette:)He's so nice.

9
00:00:24,375 --> 00:00:26,345
(Penny:)Hey, sorry about that.

10
00:00:26,344 --> 00:00:28,174
(Amy:)No, we're sorry.

11
00:00:28,179 --> 00:00:30,009
(Amy:)We never should have been
comparing relationships

12
00:00:30,014 --> 00:00:31,314
(Amy:)in the first place.

13
00:00:31,316 --> 00:00:33,546
(Sheldon:)Why? We won.

14
00:00:34,953 --> 00:00:37,153
(Sheldon:)You know, I say, next, we take
on Koothrappali and his dog.

15
00:00:37,155 --> 00:00:40,355
(Sheldon:)Really give
ourselves a challenge.

16
00:00:40,358 --> 00:00:42,388
(Leonard:)I just want to say
one more thing about this.

17
00:00:42,393 --> 00:00:44,523
(Leonard:)Just because Penny
and I are very different people

18
00:00:44,529 --> 00:00:46,359
(Leonard:)does not mean
that we're a bad couple.

19
00:00:46,364 --> 00:00:49,534
(Sheldon:)The answer is
one simple test away.

20
00:00:49,534 --> 00:00:50,664
(Sheldon:)Hmm? You know,
it's like

21
00:00:50,668 --> 00:00:53,138
(Sheldon:)when I thought there was
a possum in my closet.

22
00:00:53,137 --> 00:00:55,407
(Sheldon:)Did I sit around
wondering?

23
00:00:55,406 --> 00:00:59,146
(Sheldon:)No, I sent Leonard in with
a pointy stick and a bag.

24
00:00:59,143 --> 00:01:05,023
(Leonard:)I killed
his Chewbacca slippers.

